      <NotesHTML>﻿&lt;!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"&gt;
&lt;html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
		&lt;meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" /&gt;&lt;title&gt;
		&lt;/title&gt;
		&lt;style type="text/css"&gt;
			.cs95E872D0{text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt}
			.cs1B16EEB5{color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}
		&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;
		&lt;p class="cs95E872D0"&gt;&lt;span class="cs1B16EEB5"&gt;- Try turning registers into register file for simplicity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="cs95E872D0"&gt;&lt;span class="cs1B16EEB5"&gt;- Oscilloscope channels 3 and 4 are delayed data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</NotesHTML>
